### Test Login with Onboarding Data
### This test demonstrates the new onboarding data in login response

### Step 1: Register a user with onboarding data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "onboarding-test@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567892",
  "onboardingData": {
    "pregnancy_status": "pregnant",
    "last_period": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
    "cycle_length": 28,
    "period_length": 5,
    "pregnancy_week": 12,
    "pregnancy_progress": "first_trimester",
    "health_goals": "{\"track_period\": true, \"cycle_insights\": true, \"pregnancy_tracking\": true}",
    "notifications": true
  }
}

### Step 2: Verify email (replace with actual verification code)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "onboarding-test@example.com",
  "verify_code": "123456"
}

### Step 3: Login and check onboarding data in response
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "onboarding-test@example.com"
}

