### Step 4: Test refresh token also includes onboarding data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "your_refresh_token_from_login_response"
}

### Step 5: Test user without onboarding data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "no-onboarding@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567893"
}

### Verify email for user without onboarding data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "no-onboarding@example.com",
  "verify_code": "123456"
}

### Login for user without onboarding data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "no-onboarding@example.com"
}

